rtbeat worker','Captured worker term and peer; contact timestamp and pending verification requests','Periodic heartbeat or immediate verify notification',['S-heartbeat','S-notify','S-replicate-loop','S-net-handler'],writes=['On error-free RPC refresh lastContact and deliver resp.Success to pending verification; transport errors back off'],important_branches=['Heartbeat is independent of blocked log replication','This branch does not compare response term before refreshing contact','Network fast path accepts only empty append without predecessor or commit index'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Empty heartbeat does not call commitment.match; contact is distinct from stored-log support'},unknowns=['Whether stale-term heartbeat contact can indefinitely delay authority loss needs a scoped schedule and other worker analysis'])\nadd('B-lease','A2','Main leader loop','Latest voter set and per-peer contact timestamps','Leader lease timer',['S-lease','S-admit'],implementation_guards=['Count only Voter entries and self; compare contact age to LeaderLeaseTimeout'],writes=['Step down if recent contact count below voters/2+1'],unknowns=['Recent contact is an observation, not a proof of accepted leadership or durable support'])\nadd('B-transfer','A2','Leader loop, transfer worker and TimeoutNow receiver','Selected replication peer, transfer-in-progress flag and ensuing campaign','Public leadership transfer request',['S-transfer','S-timeout-now','S-leader-control','S-election','S-admit'],implementation_guards=['Leader gates new applies/config changes during transfer; worker waits for nextIndex beyond current lastIndex before TimeoutNow'],writes=['Receiver sets Candidate and leadership-transfer flag; campaign bypasses pre-vote and requests transfer votes'],important_branches=['Timeout or role exit stops transfer control; blocking TimeoutNow RPC itself is not cancellable','Granting votes and collecting majority still occurs; transfer is not unilateral decision authority'])\nadd('B-verify','A2','Leader verification registration and mutex-protected vote callbacks','verifyFuture identity and current quorumSize','VerifyLeader request and peer notification',['S-verify-start','S-notify','S-verify-count','S-verify-consume','S-peers'],writes=['Start at one self vote; register on all replState peers; each notifyAll drains its pending map; vote callback completes aggregation once'],implementation_guards=['quorumSize counts voters; negative notification returns early and leader loop steps down'],external_effects=['Leader loop returns nil on sufficient votes, otherwise ErrNotLeader'],unknowns=['Registration includes nonvoter replication workers; whether their success can satisfy a voter-based quorum is an untested source-grounded lead'])\nadd('B-pipeline-producer','A6','Network or in-memory pipeline decoder','Append future request/response pair','RPC response, decoding failure or timeout',['S-net-pipeline','S-inmem-pipeline','S-net-decode','S-future-complete'],writes=['Complete future with result error before publishing it to Consumer'],important_branches=['Network decodes error string and response before returning remote error; partial decode may return an error','In-memory copies response then completes with RPC error; timeout completes with error','Both publish failed as well as successful futures'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Future delivery is not equivalent to successful RPC support; consumers must interpret the result under the interface contract'})\nadd('B-config-change','A4','Leader main loop and configuration-log scanner','Latest/committed configuration index and current leader startIndex','Configuration-change request or stored configuration entry',['S-config-append','S-config-scan','S-membership','S-peers','S-consume'],implementation_guards=['Admission requires latest configuration committed and a current-term entry committed','Optional prevIndex must match; require unique nonempty IDs/addresses and at least one voter'],writes=['Dispatch full 